      "summary": "Ukraine's National Bank Council approved consolidated financial statements for 2025, recording a balance sheet total of 3.3 trillion hryvnias and a profit of 155 billion hryvnias, of which 146.1 billion will be transferred to the state budget. International reserves grew by over 30% to $57.3 billion by year-end 2025."
